      "person_id": "a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line085",
      "source_quote": "愉為江州刺史、都督豫州四郡、輔國將軍、假節。",
      "start_codepoint": 46,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "reading": "國寶死後為江州刺史、都督豫州四郡、輔國將軍、假節。",
      "note": "國寶死後為江州刺史、都督豫州四郡、輔國將軍、假節。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line087:received_sentence-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line087",
      "source_quote": "愉至鎮，未幾，殷仲堪、桓玄、楊佺期舉兵應王恭，乘流奄至。",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 28,
      "reading": "初到江州，殷仲堪、桓玄、楊佺期響應王恭。",
      "note": "初到江州，殷仲堪、桓玄、楊佺期響應王恭。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line087:received_sentence-28",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line087",
      "source_quote": "愉既無備，惶遽奔臨川，為玄所得。",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 44,
      "reading": "王愉奔臨川，為桓玄所獲。",
      "note": "王愉奔臨川，為桓玄所獲。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line087:received_sentence-44",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line087",
      "source_quote": "玄盟于尋陽，以愉置壇所，愉甚恥之。",
      "start_codepoint": 44,
      "end_codepoint": 61,
      "reading": "桓玄盟於尋陽，把王愉置於壇處，王愉以為恥。",
      "note": "桓玄盟於尋陽，把王愉置於壇處，王愉以為恥。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
